# Agent instruction files ARE tracked (ADR-0011): a repository's agent
# instructions live in the repository, not in the vault. Keeping them ignored
# left them on one disk only — absent from clones, from the mirrors, and from
# any remote or cloud agent.

/.claudeignore
/.graphifyignore

.claude/
.codex/

# Agent instruction files are generated pointers, never content, and are
# never tracked (ADR-0025). The content lives in the never-knowledge vault and
# reaches a session through the Never4gA Context Pack.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
